 * ============================================================================
 * PURPOSE
 * ============================================================================
 *
 * This file is the SINGLE CANONICAL SOURCE-GRAMMAR OWNER of lambda
 * expressions.
 *
 * A lambda is an anonymous callable expression with:
 *
 *     - zero or more parameters;
 *     - an optional explicit return type;
 *     - exactly one expression or block-expression body.
 *
 * Canonical forms:
 *
 *     || expression
 *
 *     |x| expression
 *
 *     |x, y| expression
 *
 *     |x: Int| expression
 *
 *     |x: Int, y: Float| expression
 *
 *     |x| { statement* }
 *
 *     |x| -> Int expression
 *
 *     |x| -> Int { statement* }
 *
 * This grammar describes SOURCE STRUCTURE ONLY.
 *
 * It does not perform:
 *
 *     - name resolution;
 *     - type inference;
 *     - type checking;
 *     - overload resolution;
 *     - capture analysis;
 *     - ownership analysis;
 *     - borrowing;
 *     - lifetime analysis;
 *     - effect analysis;
 *     - capability negotiation;
 *     - resource allocation;
 *     - scheduling;
 *     - routing;
 *     - optimization;
 *     - target selection;
 *     - quantum placement;
 *     - hardware realization;
 *     - runtime execution.
 *
